omparison to religious fundamentalism  of course it's all a ploy to manipulate  Plutonians into thinking the destruction  of their planet by their corporate  overlords is totally not a big deal hmm  so to pull it all together Rick and  Morty is a show that holds nothing as  sacred by exploring the absurdities of a  purely rational universe and pushing the  boundaries of decency in a sci-fi horror  setting we get to ask all sorts of fun  depressing questions like why am I here  and what's the point of it all we're not  really sure where the show will go with  Rick's character will he finally do  something for the greater good or is his  latest move just another bleak  self-serving ploy as always thanks for  watching  what would love a dub dub we hope you're  liking these special episodes we have  some amazing new videos around the  corner on the South Park movie  Hitchhiker's Guide to the galaxy and  lots more be sure to check out our  channel page by clicking here where you  can see more of our brain tickling  videos while you're over there do be  sure to hit the subscribe button another  great way to support the show is by  supporting our sponsors this episode is  sponsored by audible.com audible is the  world's leading source of digital  audiobooks they've got more than 180,000  downloadable titles across all types of  literature including bestsellers latest  releases and classics and if you're  looking for a book recommendation that's  wacky and fun like Rick and Morty and  want to be already when our video hits  check out Hitchhiker's Guide to the  galaxy by Douglas Adams for more about  audible and to start your 30-day free  trial go to audible.com slash 8bit to  sign up thanks for the support and as  always thank you for watching  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

